It is Saturday morning.
The weather is cold.
I am only wearing my jacket.
I ride my bicycle.
A large weekly market is nearby.
I am there quickly.
There are already many people here.
And I see many bicycles!
I park my bicycle.
I take my shopping bags.
I have two shopping bags.
They are still empty.
I walk into the market.
There are many stalls here.
I see fruit and vegetables.
I smell bread and coffee.
I am a little hungry.
I need food for the weekend.
Where do I start?
